{"schema_version":"1.0","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-hn5/","title":"태양 EX-HN5","language":"ko-KR","description":"경외기혈 태양의 위치·취혈·자침 정보를 정리합니다.","text":"태양 EX-HN5\n분류\n경외기혈 · 코드 EX-HN5\n위치\n눈썹 바깥쪽 끝과 目外眥의 중점으로부터 뒤로 1寸.\n취혈\n자침·주의\n直刺 0.3～0.5寸\n三稜鍼으로 點刺出血\n임상 연결\n경외기혈은 관련 부위·증상과 14경맥의 경혈을 함께 보고 배혈합니다.\n→ 경외기혈 통합 목록","sections":[{"title":"분류","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-hn5/#_1","text":"경외기혈 · 코드 EX-HN5","links":[]},{"title":"위치","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-hn5/#_2","text":"눈썹 바깥쪽 끝과 目外眥의 중점으로부터 뒤로 1寸.","links":[]},{"title":"취혈","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-hn5/#_3","text":"","links":[]},{"title":"자침·주의","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-hn5/#_4","text":"直刺 0.3～0.5寸\n三稜鍼으로 點刺出血","links":[]},{"title":"임상 연결","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-hn5/#_5","text":"경외기혈은 관련 부위·증상과 14경맥의 경혈을 함께 보고 배혈합니다.\n→ 경외기혈 통합 목록","links":["https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupoint-network/extra-points/"]}],"headings":[{"level":2,"title":"분류","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-hn5/#_1"},{"level":2,"title":"위치","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-hn5/#_2"},{"level":2,"title":"취혈","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-hn5/#_3"},{"level":2,"title":"자침·주의","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-hn5/#_4"},{"level":2,"title":"임상 연결","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-hn5/#_5"}],"links":["https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupoint-network/extra-points/"],"related_reading":[],"interpretation":"Public article text and navigation only; links do not establish clinical equivalence or treatment recommendations.","provenance":{"document_id":"MSA-37FC887A8F5911AF","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-hn5/","text_sha256"